				"text": "Twenty-two hundred— Oh, Haddock. You can’t think how relieved I am. The pirates are beaten—"
			},
			{
				"speaker": "MR. DICKENS",
				"text": "Abaft, you scurvy pirates!"
			},
			{
				"speaker": "TARA",
				"text": "That’s all right, sir."
			},
			{
				"speaker": "TARA",
				"text": "It were Mr. Dickens sir. He heard you were looking for me."
